id: keyboard-fields
section: Keyboard and text
item: Tap a field on several pages in one session: the keyboard comes up every time and the page does not jump away from the field (the field stays within reach above the keyboard)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-input-echo.html
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R2
calibrate echo
tap area
expect keyboard up 8
expect visible area
tap-at 384 100
expect keyboard down 8
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-card-events.html
calibrate bar
tap field
expect keyboard up 8
expect visible field
